{"path":"numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine","title":"std::shuffle_order_engine","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>shuffle_order_engine","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"shuffle_order_engine is a random number engine adaptor that shuffles the random numbers generated by the base engine.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/random\">&lt;random&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Engine,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> K<br><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> shuffle_order_engine<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>shuffle_order_engine</code> is a random number engine adaptor that shuffles the random numbers generated by the base engine. It maintains a table of size <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">K</span></code> and delivers a randomly selected number from that table when requested, replacing it with a number generated by the base engine.\n</p><p>The following typedef defines the random number engine with one commonly used parameter set:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/random\">&lt;random&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>knuth_b</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">shuffle_order_engine</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/linear_congruential_engine\"><span class=\"kw1495\">std::<span class=\"me2\">minstd_rand0</span></span></a>, <span class=\"nu0\">256</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> Engine\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the type of the wrapped engine\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> K\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the size of the internal table. Must be greater than <span class=\"texhtml\">0</span>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>Engine</code> must meet the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/RandomNumberEngine\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">RandomNumberEngine</em></a>.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>result_type</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <code>Engine::result_type</code>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine/shuffle_order_engine\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs the engine adaptor <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine/seed\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>seed</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the state of the underlying engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine/base\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>base</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the underlying engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Generation\">Generation </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances the state of the underlying engine and returns the generated value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/shuffle_order_engine/discard\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>discard</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances the adaptor's state by a specified amount <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Characteristics\">Characteristics </h5>\n</td></